                                                "example_id": "06d5e33f-a1cd-4815-9be5-cf347f5cff58",
                                                "sense_id": "671f016c-ab33-3352-8c32-38dc85dac4ef",
                                                "text": "Gatwick has been given a qualified green light to operate a second runway after the government “set out a path to expansion” for London’s second biggest airport."
